---
manual: styles.state.disabled
lines: [1417, 1421]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: G4
expect: fail
reason: "No control in Lacci declares :state, so the display never learns the button is disabled (see styles.state__accepted)."
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 200 do
  @count = para "0"
  @off = button "Off", state: "disabled" do
    @count.replace((@count.text.to_i + 1).to_s)
  end
end
----------- test code
click_on button("@off")
assert_equal "0", para("@count").text, "a disabled button is not active: clicking it does nothing"
